      "raw_first_column": 0,
      "raw_quote": "杜宻字周甫潁川陽城人也為人沈質少有厲俗志為¶\n司徒胡廣所辟稍遷代郡太守徴三遷太山太守北海¶\n<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_097-15b>¶\n相其宦官子弟為令長有姦惡者輒捕案之行春到髙¶\n宻縣見鄭𤣥為鄉佐知其異噐即召署郡職遂遣就學¶\n後宻去官還家每謁守令多所陳託同郡劉勝亦自蜀¶\n郡告歸鄉里閉門掃軌無所干及(軌車迹也/言絶人事)大守王昱¶\n謂宻曰劉季陵清髙士公卿多舉之者宻知昱激已對¶\n曰劉勝位為大夫見禮上賔而知善不薦聞惡無言隠¶\n情惜已自同寒蟬此罪人也(寒蟬謂寂黙也椘詞曰悲/哉秋之為氣也蟬寂寞而)¶\n(無/聲)今志義力行之賢而宻達之(力行謂盡力行善也禮/記曰好問近乎智力行)¶\n<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_097-16a>¶\n(近乎/仁)違道失節之士而宻紏之使明府賞刑得中令問¶\n休揚不亦萬分之一乎昱慚服待之彌厚後桓帝徴拜¶\n尚書令遷河南尹轉太僕黨事既起免歸本郡與李膺¶\n俱坐而名行相次故時人亦稱李杜焉(前有李固杜/喬故言亦也)後¶\n太傅陳蕃輔政復為太僕明年坐黨事被徴自殺¶",
      "body": {
        "text": "杜宻字周甫潁川陽城人也為人沈質少有厲俗志為司徒胡廣所辟稍遷代郡太守徴三遷太山太守北海相其宦官子弟為令長有姦惡者輒捕案之行春到髙宻縣見鄭𤣥為鄉佐知其異噐即召署郡職遂遣就學後宻去官還家每謁守令多所陳託同郡劉勝亦自蜀郡告歸鄉里閉門掃軌無所干及大守王昱謂宻曰劉季陵清髙士公卿多舉之者宻知昱激已對曰劉勝位為大夫見禮上賔而知善不薦聞惡無言隠情惜已自同寒蟬此罪人也今志義力行之賢而宻達之違道失節之士而宻紏之使明府賞刑得中令問休揚不亦萬分之一乎昱慚服待之彌厚後桓帝徴拜尚書令遷河南尹轉太僕黨事既起免歸本郡與李膺俱坐而名行相次故時人亦稱李杜焉後太傅陳蕃輔政復為太僕明年坐黨事被徴自殺",
        "raw_runs": [
          {
            "raw_line": 266,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "杜宻字周甫潁川陽城人也為人沈質少有厲俗志為"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 267,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "司徒胡廣所辟稍遷代郡太守徴三遷太山太守北海"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 269,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "相其宦官子弟為令長有姦惡者輒捕案之行春到髙"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 270,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "宻縣見鄭𤣥為鄉佐知其異噐即召署郡職遂遣就學"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 271,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "後宻去官還家每謁守令多所陳託同郡劉勝亦自蜀"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 272,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 13,
            "surface": "郡告歸鄉里閉門掃軌無所干及"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 272,
            "raw_start": 24,
            "raw_end": 28,
            "surface": "大守王昱"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 273,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "謂宻曰劉季陵清髙士公卿多舉之者宻知昱激已對"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 274,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "曰劉勝位為大夫見禮上賔而知善不薦聞惡無言隠"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 275,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 11,
            "surface": "情惜已自同寒蟬此罪人也"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 276,
            "raw_start": 5,
            "raw_end": 16,
            "surface": "今志義力行之賢而宻達之"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 278,
            "raw_start": 6,
            "raw_end": 25,
            "surface": "違道失節之士而宻紏之使明府賞刑得中令問"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 279,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "休揚不亦萬分之一乎昱慚服待之彌厚後桓帝徴拜"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 280,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 21,
            "surface": "尚書令遷河南尹轉太僕黨事既起免歸本郡與李膺"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 281,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 15,
            "surface": "俱坐而名行相次故時人亦稱李杜焉"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 281,
            "raw_start": 28,
            "raw_end": 29,
            "surface": "後"
          },
          {
            "raw_line": 282,
            "raw_start": 0,
            "raw_end": 19,
            "surface": "太傅陳蕃輔政復為太僕明年坐黨事被徴自殺"
          }
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ccccfd92b9cc82f6b1d13350f9180554c79316ff03fceadec01771b21c17daa8"
      },
      "lixian_notes": [
        {
          "parent_body_offset": 118,
          "text": "軌車迹也言絶人事",
          "raw_runs": [
            {
              "raw_line": 272,
              "raw_start": 14,
              "raw_end": 18,
              "surface": "軌車迹也"
            },
            {
              "raw_line": 272,
              "raw_start": 19,
              "raw_end": 23,
              "surface": "言絶人事"
            }
          ],
          "text_sha256": "38a6a0b132502ccb413403688455c36af2391f6d08424413128dd7f71f469063"
        },
        {
          "parent_body_offset": 175,
          "text": "寒蟬謂寂黙也椘詞曰悲哉秋之為氣也蟬寂寞而無聲",
          "raw_runs": [
            {
              "raw_line": 275,
              "raw_start": 12,
              "raw_end": 22,
              "surface": "寒蟬謂寂黙也椘詞曰悲"
            },
            {
              "raw_line": 275,
              "raw_start": 23,
              "raw_end": 33,
              "surface": "哉秋之為氣也蟬寂寞而"
            },
            {
              "raw_line": 276,
              "raw_start": 1,
              "raw_end": 2,
              "surface": "無"
            },
            {
              "raw_line": 276,
              "raw_start": 3,
              "raw_end": 4,
              "surface": "聲"
            }
          ],
          "text_sha256": "3ce57f5a1c738f07bebd6d74d2cc77d11b06a7e464f049822643502f76842044"
        },
        {
          "parent_body_offset": 186,
          "text": "力行謂盡力行善也禮記曰好問近乎智力行近乎仁",
          "raw_runs": [
            {
              "raw_line": 276,
              "raw_start": 17,
              "raw_end": 26,
              "surface": "力行謂盡力行善也禮"
            },
            {
              "raw_line": 276,
              "raw_start": 27,
              "raw_end": 36,
              "surface": "記曰好問近乎智力行"
            },
            {
              "raw_line": 278,
              "raw_start": 1,
              "raw_end": 3,
              "surface": "近乎"
            },
            {
              "raw_line": 278,
              "raw_start": 4,
              "raw_end": 5,
              "surface": "仁"
            }
          ],
          "text_sha256": "e2dad9583897c52244e87cc3e49c9b67a0426db6c38d7f2f8c6f2af8a6a77865"
        },
        {
          "parent_body_offset": 262,
          "text": "前有李固杜喬故言亦也",
          "raw_runs": [
            {
              "raw_line": 281,
              "raw_start": 16,
              "raw_end": 21,
              "surface": "前有李固杜"
            },
            {
              "raw_line": 281,
              "raw_start": 22,
              "raw_end": 27,
              "surface": "喬故言亦也"
            }
          ],
          "text_sha256": "20c80a1bcf693db025bc23eb103244da12f7067466343cf14c7d4ed82c902268"
        }
      ]
